# CHECK: Reads:JSPropertyNameEnumerator_cachedPropertyNamesVectorContents, {{*}}:ForInStep)
# CHECK: Int64 b@{{*}} = Patchpoint(b@[[list]]:Register({{*}}), b@[[key]]:Register({{*}}), resultConstraints = Register(
# CHECK: Patchpoint(b@[[list]]:ColdAny, {{*}}:EnumeratorGetByVal)
# CHECK: Int64 b@{{*}} = Patchpoint(b@[[list]]:Register({{*}}), b@[[key]]:Register({{*}}), resultConstraints = Register({{*}}:ElemGet)
# CHECK-LABEL: end of loop
# The enumerator is made once, and the run time is asked for a key only where the enumerator's own list of names has none.
